    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96">

                <pb facs="0212" n="96" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg96"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.811/50.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Minister Calhoun.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-06-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 12, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Referring to previous telegrams. Mr. Charles Davis Jameson has been engaged by
                    the Red Cross to study and report upon river conservancy and will leave for
                    Peking via Siberia within a few days. You will be informed of exact date later.
                    You will inform Chinese Government of Mr. Jameson’s appointment and afford him
                    every possible facility in his mission.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
